    </subflows>
    <textTemplates>
        <description>The body of the email if the case is a Billing error case.</description>
        <name>TextTemplate_EmailBody_BillingError</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Hello {!$Record.Contact.FirstName},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We are reaching out to let you know that we recently identified a billing error on your account and we were unable to process your latest payment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;To ensure there is minimal interruption to your service, please update your payment details as soon as possible. You can easily do this directly within the EverQuote Pro platform:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Log in to your EverQuote Pro account at [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://pro.everquote.com/eq&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Click Here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Click on the “Billing” option on the left-hand side of your screen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Scroll down to the “Credit Card” section on the billing page to review and/or update your card information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;If you have any questions, believe you received this in error, or need help navigating the EverQuote Pro platform, I’m happy to help! Just reply directly to this email or book time with me directly using the link below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Best regards,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;{!Formula_EmailBody_Signer}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;{!Formula_EmailBody_CalendarLink}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
